{"title":"Career Roadmap: Guest Relations Executive","role":"Guest Relations Executive","summary":"A Guest Relations Executive (GRE) is responsible for creating a positive guest experience throughout the customer's interaction with a hotel, resort, restaurant, cruise, club, serviced apartment or other hospitality business.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Sc (General / Honours)","Course":"Hospitality Science"},"about":[{"label":"Primary Goal","text":"Build guest-service, communication, hotel operations, complaint handling and customer-experience management skills"}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Roadmap Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"A Guest Relations Executive (GRE) is responsible for creating a positive guest experience throughout the customer's interaction with a hotel, resort, restaurant, cruise, club, serviced apartment or other hospitality business."},{"type":"p","text":"The role combines:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Guest Service","Communication","Hotel Operations","Problem Solving","Customer Experience","CRM"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"A strong candidate should be able to understand guest needs, coordinate with multiple departments, resolve service issues and maintain professional relationships with guests."}]},{"heading":"What to Build During UG","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Build This","Learn From","Proof of Skill","Gap to Avoid"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Hospitality fundamentals"},{"text":"Hotel operations, communication, food & beverage"},{"text":"Service simulations"},{"text":"Weak communication"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Front-office & guest relations"},{"text":"Reservations, check-in/out, PMS, complaint handling"},{"text":"Practical hotel exercises"},{"text":"Knowing theory but not operations"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Customer experience + management"},{"text":"CRM, service recovery, revenue basics"},{"text":"Internship + guest-service projects"},{"text":"No real guest interaction"}],[{"text":"Year 4*"},{"text":"Leadership + digital hospitality"},{"text":"Analytics, CRM, service quality"},{"text":"Capstone + internship"},{"text":"No measurable portfolio"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"*Applicable where the B.Sc. program is four years."}]},{"heading":"Semester-by-Semester Roadmap","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Semester 1"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Introduction to hospitality"},{"text":"Hospitality industry structure"},{"text":"Hotel departments"},{"text":"Professional communication"},{"text":"English communication"},{"text":"Personality development"},{"text":"Customer-service fundamentals"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semester 2"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Front-office operations"},{"text":"Housekeeping fundamentals"},{"text":"Food & beverage service"},{"text":"Food production basics"},{"text":"Hotel terminology"},{"text":"Telephone etiquette"},{"text":"Email etiquette"},{"text":"Professional grooming"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semester 3"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Guest relations"},{"text":"Reservations"},{"text":"Check-in/check-out"},{"text":"Guest registration"},{"text":"Room allocation"},{"text":"Concierge services"},{"text":"Complaint handling"},{"text":"Service recovery"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semester 4"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Hotel property-management systems"},{"text":"Customer relationship management"},{"text":"Guest feedback"},{"text":"Service quality"},{"text":"Hospitality accounting basics"},{"text":"Tourism fundamentals"},{"text":"Cross-cultural communication"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semester 5"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Guest experience management"},{"text":"VIP/VVIP guest handling"},{"text":"Event coordination"},{"text":"Upselling and cross-selling"},{"text":"Hotel sales fundamentals"},{"text":"Revenue-management basics"},{"text":"Hospitality analytics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semester 6"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Service quality management"},{"text":"Customer-experience design"},{"text":"Hospitality technology"},{"text":"Digital marketing"},{"text":"Online reputation management"},{"text":"Leadership"},{"text":"Internship preparation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semester 7–8, if applicable"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Advanced guest experience"},{"text":"Hospitality analytics"},{"text":"Revenue and commercial fundamentals"},{"text":"Strategic hospitality management"},{"text":"Capstone project"},{"text":"Industry internship"}]}]},{"heading":"Hospitality Industry Fundamentals","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Understand the structure of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Hotels"},{"text":"Resorts"},{"text":"Boutique hotels"},{"text":"Business hotels"},{"text":"Luxury hotels"},{"text":"Budget hotels"},{"text":"Serviced apartments"},{"text":"Hostels"},{"text":"Cruise hospitality"},{"text":"Clubs"},{"text":"Restaurants"},{"text":"Convention centres"},{"text":"Corporate hospitality"},{"text":"Travel and tourism services"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand how departments interact:"},{"type":"h","text":"Front Office ↔ Housekeeping ↔ Food & Beverage ↔ Engineering ↔ Security ↔ Sales ↔ Finance"},{"type":"p","text":"Guest Relations sits at the intersection of many of these departments."}]},{"heading":"Front Office Skills","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Master:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Reservations"},{"text":"Room inventory"},{"text":"Check-in"},{"text":"Check-out"},{"text":"Room allocation"},{"text":"Room status"},{"text":"Key management"},{"text":"Guest registration"},{"text":"Billing coordination"},{"text":"Concierge services"},{"text":"Wake-up calls"},{"text":"Guest messages"},{"text":"Luggage coordination"},{"text":"Transportation arrangements"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand common hotel terms such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"FIT"},{"text":"GIT"},{"text":"OTA"},{"text":"ADR"},{"text":"RevPAR"},{"text":"Occupancy"},{"text":"No-show"},{"text":"Walk-in"},{"text":"Upgrade"},{"text":"Complimentary room"},{"text":"Early check-in"},{"text":"Late check-out"}]}]},{"heading":"Guest Relations Skills","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn how to:"},{"type":"h","text":"Welcome Guests"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Professional greeting"},{"text":"Guest recognition"},{"text":"Personalization"},{"text":"Introduction to hotel facilities"},{"text":"Special-occasion recognition"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Understand Guest Needs"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Ask appropriate questions"},{"text":"Listen actively"},{"text":"Identify preferences"},{"text":"Record guest requirements"},{"text":"Coordinate special requests"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Resolve Problems"},{"type":"p","text":"Use:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Listen","Understand","Apologize appropriately","Solve","Follow up","Document"]},{"type":"p","text":"Common situations:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Room dissatisfaction"},{"text":"Delayed service"},{"text":"Billing issue"},{"text":"Noise complaint"},{"text":"Housekeeping issue"},{"text":"Restaurant complaint"},{"text":"Lost property"},{"text":"Transportation problem"},{"text":"Special-request failure"}]}]},{"heading":"Service Recovery","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Guest relations professionals should understand the difference between:"},{"type":"p","text":"Complaint handling and service recovery."},{"type":"p","text":"Service recovery aims to restore the guest's confidence after a service failure."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Empathy"},{"text":"Ownership"},{"text":"Appropriate escalation"},{"text":"Compensation guidelines"},{"text":"Follow-up"},{"text":"Documentation"},{"text":"Root-cause identification"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Do not promise compensation outside the hotel's authority."}]},{"heading":"Communication Skills","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Develop excellent:"},{"type":"h","text":"Verbal Communication"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Clear speech"},{"text":"Professional vocabulary"},{"text":"Active listening"},{"text":"Telephone etiquette"},{"text":"Conflict communication"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Written Communication"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Email"},{"text":"WhatsApp/business messaging"},{"text":"Guest notes"},{"text":"Internal communication"},{"text":"Incident reports"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Non-Verbal Communication"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Body language"},{"text":"Eye contact"},{"text":"Professional posture"},{"text":"Facial expression"},{"text":"Personal presentation"}]}]},{"heading":"Language Skills","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"English is particularly important for international hospitality."},{"type":"p","text":"Useful additional languages depend on the target market."},{"type":"p","text":"Potential choices:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Hindi"},{"text":"Telugu"},{"text":"Tamil"},{"text":"Kannada"},{"text":"Malayalam"},{"text":"French"},{"text":"German"},{"text":"Spanish"},{"text":"Arabic"},{"text":"Mandarin"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The student should prioritize functional communication ability rather than collecting language certificates."}]},{"heading":"Hotel Property Management Systems","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Develop familiarity with hotel technology such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Property Management Systems"},{"text":"Reservation systems"},{"text":"Point-of-sale systems"},{"text":"CRM systems"},{"text":"Guest-feedback systems"},{"text":"Housekeeping systems"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Examples of PMS/technology ecosystems include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Oracle OPERA"},{"text":"Cloudbeds"},{"text":"Mews"},{"text":"Stayntouch"},{"text":"Amadeus hospitality solutions"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Exact systems vary by hotel/company."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn concepts such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Reservation creation"},{"text":"Guest profiles"},{"text":"Room inventory"},{"text":"Room status"},{"text":"Check-in/check-out"},{"text":"Billing"},{"text":"Guest preferences"},{"text":"Reports"}]}]},{"heading":"Customer Relationship Management","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn how hospitality organizations maintain guest profiles."},{"type":"p","text":"Track:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Guest preferences"},{"text":"Stay history"},{"text":"Special occasions"},{"text":"Complaints"},{"text":"Feedback"},{"text":"Service requests"},{"text":"Loyalty information"},{"text":"Communication preferences"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Guest data","Personalization","Better experience","Loyalty","Repeat business"]},{"type":"p","text":"Privacy and access controls are important when handling guest information."}]},{"heading":"Guest Experience Management","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn to measure:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Guest satisfaction"},{"text":"Complaint rate"},{"text":"Response time"},{"text":"Resolution time"},{"text":"Repeat visits"},{"text":"Review ratings"},{"text":"Customer loyalty"},{"text":"Service quality"},{"text":"Net Promoter Score concepts"},{"text":"Customer effort"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Guest Journey"},{"type":"flow","items":["Search","Booking","Pre-arrival","Arrival","Stay","Service","Checkout","Post-stay"]},{"type":"p","text":"Identify opportunities to improve every stage."}]},{"heading":"Online Reputation Management","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Understand how hotels are evaluated on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Google"},{"text":"Booking platforms"},{"text":"Trip-advisor-type review platforms"},{"text":"Social media"},{"text":"Hotel websites"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Review monitoring"},{"text":"Review categorization"},{"text":"Response writing"},{"text":"Complaint identification"},{"text":"Sentiment analysis"},{"text":"Recurring issue detection"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A guest relations professional should never manipulate or fabricate reviews."}]},{"heading":"Upselling & Cross-Selling","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn ethical upselling such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Room upgrades"},{"text":"Breakfast"},{"text":"Airport transfers"},{"text":"Spa services"},{"text":"Dining"},{"text":"Experiences"},{"text":"Late checkout"},{"text":"Premium amenities"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand the difference between:"},{"type":"p","text":"Recommending something useful and pressuring the guest into purchasing it."}]},{"heading":"VIP/VVIP Guest Handling","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Pre-arrival planning"},{"text":"Guest preference review"},{"text":"Room readiness"},{"text":"Welcome arrangements"},{"text":"Personalized communication"},{"text":"Cross-department coordination"},{"text":"Privacy"},{"text":"Security coordination"},{"text":"Post-arrival follow-up"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Special care is required for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Business executives"},{"text":"Celebrities"},{"text":"Diplomats"},{"text":"Corporate clients"},{"text":"High-value loyalty members"}]}]},{"heading":"Event & Group Guest Management","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Group reservations"},{"text":"Conferences"},{"text":"Weddings"},{"text":"Corporate events"},{"text":"Banquets"},{"text":"Meetings"},{"text":"Delegations"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand coordination between:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Sales","Events","Front Office","Housekeeping","F&B","Security","Engineering"]}]},{"heading":"Hospitality Analytics","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A modern Guest Relations Executive should understand basic data analysis."},{"type":"p","text":"Track:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Occupancy"},{"text":"ADR"},{"text":"RevPAR"},{"text":"Guest satisfaction"},{"text":"Complaint frequency"},{"text":"Resolution time"},{"text":"Review scores"},{"text":"Repeat-guest rate"},{"text":"Upselling conversion"},{"text":"Service-response time"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Tools"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Tableau"},{"text":"Basic SQL"},{"text":"Basic Python"}]}]},{"heading":"Projects to Build","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Guest Feedback Dashboard"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a dashboard showing:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Satisfaction score"},{"text":"Complaint categories"},{"text":"Department-wise complaints"},{"text":"Response time"},{"text":"Resolution time"},{"text":"Monthly trends"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Hotel Guest Journey Map"},{"type":"p","text":"Map:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Booking","Pre-arrival","Arrival","Room","Dining","Facilities","Checkout","Post-stay"]},{"type":"p","text":"Identify:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Pain points"},{"text":"Service gaps"},{"text":"Improvement opportunities"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Guest Complaint Management System"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a simple system containing:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Guest complaint"},{"text":"Category"},{"text":"Department"},{"text":"Priority"},{"text":"Assigned employee"},{"text":"Response time"},{"text":"Resolution"},{"text":"Follow-up"},{"text":"Guest feedback"}]}]},{"heading":"Advanced Capstone Project","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Smart Guest Experience Management Platform"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a hospitality CRM/dashboard combining:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Guest Data","CRM","Feedback","Complaint Management","Analytics"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Features:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Guest profile"},{"text":"Preference management"},{"text":"Service requests"},{"text":"Complaint tracking"},{"text":"Sentiment analysis"},{"text":"Department assignment"},{"text":"Escalation"},{"text":"Resolution tracking"},{"text":"Guest satisfaction dashboard"},{"text":"Review analytics"},{"text":"Personalized service recommendations"}]},{"type":"p","text":"AI can assist with classification and recommendations, but sensitive guest decisions should remain under appropriate human oversight."}]},{"heading":"Specialization Options","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Specialization","Additional Skills"],"rows":[[{"text":"Luxury Hospitality"},{"text":"VIP service, personalization"}],[{"text":"Front Office"},{"text":"PMS, reservations, operations"}],[{"text":"Guest Experience"},{"text":"CX, service design, CRM"}],[{"text":"Concierge"},{"text":"Local knowledge, travel services"}],[{"text":"Hotel Sales"},{"text":"B2B sales, negotiation"}],[{"text":"Events"},{"text":"Event planning, coordination"}],[{"text":"Resort Operations"},{"text":"Recreation, activities, guest engagement"}],[{"text":"Cruise Hospitality"},{"text":"Maritime hospitality, international guests"}],[{"text":"Corporate Hospitality"},{"text":"Business travel, corporate accounts"}],[{"text":"Revenue Management"},{"text":"Pricing, forecasting, analytics"}],[{"text":"Hospitality Analytics"},{"text":"Excel, SQL, Power BI"}],[{"text":"Digital Hospitality"},{"text":"CRM, technology, digital experience"}]]}]},{"heading":"Tools & Technology","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Essential"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MS Excel"},{"text":"PowerPoint"},{"text":"Word"},{"text":"Email"},{"text":"CRM concepts"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Hospitality Systems"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"OPERA/PMS concepts"},{"text":"POS systems"},{"text":"Reservation systems"},{"text":"Guest-feedback platforms"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Analytics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Tableau"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Python basics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Communication"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Professional email"},{"text":"Business messaging"},{"text":"Digital guest communication"}]}]},{"heading":"Internships","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Target:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Hotels"},{"text":"Resorts"},{"text":"Luxury properties"},{"text":"Business hotels"},{"text":"Boutique hotels"},{"text":"Convention centres"},{"text":"Cruise companies"},{"text":"Clubs"},{"text":"Hospitality groups"},{"text":"Travel companies"},{"text":"Corporate hospitality organizations"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended Rotations"},{"type":"p","text":"Try to experience:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Front Office"},{"text":"Guest Relations"},{"text":"Housekeeping"},{"text":"Food & Beverage"},{"text":"Reservations"},{"text":"Sales"},{"text":"Events"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This creates a much stronger understanding of the complete guest journey."}]},{"heading":"Certifications & Learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Useful supplementary areas:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Hospitality operations"},{"text":"Customer experience"},{"text":"Hotel PMS"},{"text":"Guest relations"},{"text":"Food safety"},{"text":"First aid"},{"text":"Service quality"},{"text":"Revenue management"},{"text":"Hospitality analytics"},{"text":"Digital marketing"},{"text":"Communication skills"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Certifications are supplementary. Practical hotel experience, communication ability and operational knowledge are generally more important for entry-level guest-relations roles."}]},{"heading":"Entry-Level Careers","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Possible roles include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Guest Relations Executive"},{"text":"Guest Relations Associate"},{"text":"Guest Service Executive"},{"text":"Guest Experience Associate"},{"text":"Front Office Associate"},{"text":"Front Desk Executive"},{"text":"Customer Experience Executive"},{"text":"Concierge Executive"},{"text":"Lobby Ambassador"},{"text":"Front Office Executive"},{"text":"Reservations Executive"},{"text":"Hospitality Executive"},{"text":"Customer Service Executive"},{"text":"VIP Guest Relations Executive"},{"text":"Hotel Operations Executive"}]}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate Study in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Potential pathways:"},{"type":"h","text":"Hospitality"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"M.Sc Hospitality Management"},{"text":"M.Sc Hotel Management"},{"text":"Master of Hotel Management"},{"text":"Hospitality Administration"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Business"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MBA Hospitality"},{"text":"MBA Tourism"},{"text":"MBA Marketing"},{"text":"MBA Operations"},{"text":"MBA International Business"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Specialized"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Tourism Management"},{"text":"Event Management"},{"text":"Luxury Brand Management"},{"text":"Customer Experience Management"},{"text":"Hospitality Analytics"}]}]},{"heading":"Study Abroad","kind":"abroad","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Potential postgraduate areas:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"International Hospitality Management"},{"text":"Hotel Management"},{"text":"Luxury Hospitality"},{"text":"Tourism Management"},{"text":"Hospitality Business"},{"text":"Hospitality Analytics"},{"text":"Event Management"},{"text":"Customer Experience"},{"text":"International Tourism"},{"text":"Resort Management"},{"text":"Cruise Management"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Countries with substantial hospitality sectors include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Switzerland"},{"text":"France"},{"text":"UK"},{"text":"Australia"},{"text":"UAE"},{"text":"Singapore"},{"text":"Canada"},{"text":"USA"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Program quality and employment outcomes should be evaluated based on the specific institution, internship opportunities and local work-authorization rules."}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"0–2 Years"},{"type":"flow","items":["Guest Relations Executive","Guest Relations Associate","Front Office Executive"]},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Guest handling"},{"text":"PMS"},{"text":"Complaint resolution"},{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"Hotel operations"}]},{"type":"h","text":"2–5 Years"},{"type":"flow","items":["Senior Guest Relations Executive","Guest Relations Supervisor","Guest Experience Supervisor"]},{"type":"p","text":"Build:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Team coordination"},{"text":"VIP management"},{"text":"Service recovery"},{"text":"Guest analytics"},{"text":"Training"}]},{"type":"h","text":"5–8 Years"},{"type":"flow","items":["Guest Relations Manager","Guest Experience Manager","Front Office Manager"]},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Department management"},{"text":"Service quality"},{"text":"Guest loyalty"},{"text":"Revenue coordination"},{"text":"Team leadership"}]},{"type":"h","text":"8+ Years"},{"type":"p","text":"Possible directions:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Director of Guest Experience"},{"text":"Rooms Division Manager"},{"text":"Front Office Director"},{"text":"Hotel Operations Manager"},{"text":"Guest Experience Consultant"},{"text":"Hotel General Manager"}]}]},{"heading":"Long-Term Relevance: 2030–2046","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Hospitality will increasingly combine human service with digital personalization."},{"type":"p","text":"Important trends include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI-powered guest assistants"},{"text":"Digital check-in"},{"text":"Mobile room keys"},{"text":"Personalized hotel experiences"},{"text":"Smart rooms"},{"text":"Voice-enabled hotel services"},{"text":"Predictive guest-service systems"},{"text":"Sentiment analytics"},{"text":"Automated feedback analysis"},{"text":"Contactless services"},{"text":"Hospitality CRM"},{"text":"Revenue optimization"},{"text":"Virtual concierge systems"}]},{"type":"p","text":"However, human skills will remain important for complex complaints, emotional situations, VIP relationships, cultural interactions and high-value guest experiences."}]},{"heading":"Recommended Final Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Hospitality Operations"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Front office"},{"text":"Reservations"},{"text":"Housekeeping coordination"},{"text":"F&B coordination"},{"text":"Concierge"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Guest Relations"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"Active listening"},{"text":"Complaint handling"},{"text":"Service recovery"},{"text":"VIP management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Business"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Upselling"},{"text":"Cross-selling"},{"text":"Revenue basics"},{"text":"Sales"},{"text":"Customer retention"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Digital"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"PMS"},{"text":"CRM"},{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"SQL basics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Professional"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"English communication"},{"text":"Additional languages"},{"text":"Grooming"},{"text":"Cross-cultural communication"},{"text":"Conflict management"},{"text":"Leadership"}]}]},{"heading":"Final Portfolio Target","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"By graduation, the student should ideally have:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Hotel guest feedback dashboard"},{"text":"Guest journey/service-design project"},{"text":"Complaint management system"},{"text":"Hospitality CRM case study"},{"text":"Online reputation analysis"},{"text":"Guest-service recovery casebook"},{"text":"Hotel PMS practical exposure"},{"text":"Industry internship"},{"text":"At least one hospitality analytics project"},{"text":"Professional communication portfolio"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Target Graduate Profile"},{"type":"p","text":"B.Sc. Hospitality Science → Hospitality Fundamentals → Front Office → Guest Relations → PMS/CRM → Communication → Complaint Handling → Service Recovery → Guest Experience → Hospitality Analytics → Internship → Guest Relations Executive → Senior Guest Relations Executive → Guest Experience Manager → Front Office/Rooms Division Manager → Hotel Operations Leadership."}]}]}